The above proof for the vanishing of this term generalizes easily through the Fourier transform in eq. (A.4) to any metric, $g^{\prime}$ , which admits an expansion of the form

$$ g^{\prime}_{\mu\nu}(x)=\eta_{\mu\nu}+\sum_{n}\frac{g_{\mu\nu}^{\prime(n)}}{\lvert x_{\perp}\rvert^{(d-3)n}}. $$

